{"4821700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ritual Break", "steam_appid": 4821700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/d595737b3abf6409682c6eb882a76a82.poster.avif?t=1787915608\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/d595737b3abf6409682c6eb882a76a82.webm?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/d595737b3abf6409682c6eb882a76a82.mp4?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual Break is a boss rush bullet hell focused on teamwork, timing, and control.</strong> <br>Play solo by commanding two heroes or team up with a friend in local co-op as you challenge colossal demonic bosses inside an ancient ritual arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/4eea29b3bfa55bf129b6b626abd7306a.poster.avif?t=1787915608\" width=614 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/4eea29b3bfa55bf129b6b626abd7306a.webm?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/4eea29b3bfa55bf129b6b626abd7306a.mp4?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Sigil Field to reflect or control enemy projectiles, swap formations to adapt to incoming threats, and upgrade your abilities throughout each ritual. Every encounter pushes players to balance aggression and survival while overcoming unique boss mechanics and increasingly dangerous bullet patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/384e1ed28e04535f8022a1bb7171cdb1.poster.avif?t=1787915608\" width=614 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/384e1ed28e04535f8022a1bb7171cdb1.webm?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/384e1ed28e04535f8022a1bb7171cdb1.mp4?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playable solo or in local co-op with remote play.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/d595737b3abf6409682c6eb882a76a82.poster.avif?t=1787915608\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/d595737b3abf6409682c6eb882a76a82.webm?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/d595737b3abf6409682c6eb882a76a82.mp4?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual Break is a boss rush bullet hell focused on teamwork, timing, and control.</strong> <br>Play solo by commanding two heroes or team up with a friend in local co-op as you challenge colossal demonic bosses inside an ancient ritual arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/4eea29b3bfa55bf129b6b626abd7306a.poster.avif?t=1787915608\" width=614 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/4eea29b3bfa55bf129b6b626abd7306a.webm?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/4eea29b3bfa55bf129b6b626abd7306a.mp4?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Sigil Field to reflect or control enemy projectiles, swap formations to adapt to incoming threats, and upgrade your abilities throughout each ritual. Every encounter pushes players to balance aggression and survival while overcoming unique boss mechanics and increasingly dangerous bullet patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/384e1ed28e04535f8022a1bb7171cdb1.poster.avif?t=1787915608\" width=614 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/384e1ed28e04535f8022a1bb7171cdb1.webm?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821700/extras/384e1ed28e04535f8022a1bb7171cdb1.mp4?t=1787915608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playable solo or in local co-op with remote play.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p>", "short_description": "Ritual Break is a co-op boss rush bullet hell where two heroes synchronize their abilities, manipulate enemy attacks, and challenge colossal demonic bosses within an ancient ritual arena.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://